    ▓ BufferA -> Shape and you can play with speed and size

    ▓ image -> @Shane mipmap bloom, jitter blue noise

    ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓
