    ▓ Definition 3.1: Dot Product

        if a dot b > 0 { 0 < [a,b] < π/2 }
        if a dot b < 0 { π/2 < [a,b] <= π }
        if a dot b = 0 { [a,b] orthogonal, [a,b] = π/2, a || b = 0}
    ▓

    ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓
