    ▓  Minimal texture height map setup
    ▓  Based on Shane's "Bioorganic Wall" technique
    ▓  https://www.shadertoy.com/view/ldt3RN

    ▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓▓
